      289.61,
      401.9,
      357.71
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act theCorporation shall be carried out by a Committee ofManagement (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Committee\u201d)consisting of such number of office bearers as may bespecified by the rules made under section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
